{
  // evidenceAllStandards — THE BRONZE GRAPH (TQ, 2026-07-31): every standard's base + the CEDS hub +
  // every property-tier mapping the CURRENT (evidence-era) machinery can produce, in ONE graph, for
  // deployment to the dev DME. This is the first graph whose every mapping edge is produced by the
  // current tree — zero legacy edges (the 100%-new-graph goal's first full rehearsal, minus SIF).
  //
  // WHAT IS DELIBERATELY ABSENT (say it here so absence reads as decision, not omission):
  //   - SIF mapping: base nodes ONLY (browsable in the DME, sequence-stamped by the Phase-A forge).
  //     Its 15,620-judgment sifEvidenceBridge run is gated behind TQ's examine-the-bronze-first
  //     ruling AND the judgment-cache + dedupe machinery (P9).
  //   - CIP<->SOC crosswalk: no crosswalk producer exists in the current tree (survey open question 1
  //     — the golden's 8,324 CLASSIFICATION_CROSSWALK edges are legacy output); both standards load
  //     as bases. A current-tree crosswalk producer is roadmap work.
  //   - Value-tier (codeset) mapping: still lives on the marked relic path (semanticBridge et al.) —
  //     property-tier only here, per the roadmap's value-tier re-expression debt. EXCEPTION: CTDL's
  //     26 native value-tier anchors DO land, via ctdlAuthoredBridge (authored, zero-LLM).
  //
  // Judgment volume (property-tier, via genericBridge unless noted): ctdl 378, lif 1023, dctap 12,
  // clr 184, openbadges 170, case 194 (caseEvidenceBridge), eduapi 319, jedx 139, medbiquitous 1261,
  // pesc 1792 ≈ 5,472 Opus judgments. Zero-LLM: edfi+sedm (authoredAnchorBridge), ctdl authored,
  // ctdl-family structural. All judgments flow through the judgment cache (decided = persisted) and
  // the matchForensics log (P9).
  "schemaVersion": "1.0.0",
  "recipeName": "evidenceAllStandards",
  "kind": "dev",
  "description": "The bronze graph: all 18 standard bases + CEDS hub + every current-machinery property-tier mapping (generic evidence bridges for the inferred standards, caseEvidenceBridge for CASE, authoredAnchorBridge for EdFi/SEDM, CTDL authored + family structural). SIF base-only; no CIP/SOC crosswalk (no current producer); value-tier deferred.",
  "standards": [
    { "token": "ceds", "version": "current" },
    { "token": "ctdl", "version": "current" },
    { "token": "ctdlasn", "version": "current" },
    { "token": "ctdlqdata", "version": "current" },
    { "token": "lif", "version": "current" },
